      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'Your job is to rescue people who are lost in the forest.

    

    Look
    at the forest, as soon as you see a signal light, turn on the radio and look
    for the frequency where the human voice is heard. Put this frequency into the
    antenna communicator. After that, adjust the antennas until the light turns green.
    Once all of this is done, call 911'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
